; Exports for WrathClassicAPI.dll.
;
; `Load` is LichCore's post-injection entry point: after LichLoader injects
; each lichloader.txt DLL and the game resumes, LichCore calls the DLL's
; `Load` export on the game's MAIN thread (GetProcAddress(module, "Load")),
; outside the loader lock and with no timeout. Listing it here exports it
; undecorated as "Load" so GetProcAddress finds it regardless of calling
; convention. See the loader-lock rationale in src/DllMain.cpp.
EXPORTS
    Load
